{
  "name": "conductor-ai",
  "version": "0.10.0",
  "description": "Your coding agent plans and reviews; free and cheap models write the code. Multi-LLM orchestrator with Claude Code, Codex CLI, Antigravity CLI or OpenCode as the controller and agents, 45+ APIs and local models (Ollama) as workers: quota-aware fallback, task routing, per-agent sandboxes, checks on every task and parallel worktrees.",
